    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        262.77178955078125,
        527.39599609375,
        277.2148132324219
      ],
      "text": "The highest quality rating is usually assigned to evidence gathered from randomized control trials,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.971923828125,
        527.6083984375,
        290.4149475097656
      ],
      "text": "while evidence from observational studies, including programmatic data, may usually assigned a low",
